# Leg Day
unit: kg
description: Quads, hamstrings, and glutes.

Barbell Squat | reps 4x6 | 80 | rest 2m30s
Romanian Deadlift | reps 3x10 | 60 | rest 1m30s
Leg Press | reps 3x12 | 120 | rest 1m30s
Barbell Walking Lunge | reps 3x12 | 16 | rest 1m
Seated Leg Curl | reps 3x12 | 35 | rest 1m
Standing Calf Raises | reps 4x15 | 40 | rest 45s
